## Conclusion
This project demonstrates PCA and LDA for dimensionality reduction on a real-world Kaggle dataset. 
PCA provides an unsupervised view preserving overall data variance, while LDA leverages labels for class discrimination. 
These visualizations aid in understanding dataset structure and can serve as a preprocessing step for machine learning models.

